title: Second Eastern Expedition
subtitle: End of the Line.
tags: events
view-if: year = 1925 and month >= 9 and eastexped_done = 1
max-visits: 1
priority: 2
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.chen_casualties = 0;
Q.nra_casualties = 0;
Q.nra_winchen = 0;
Q.nra_losechen = 0;
!}

= Second East River Campaign

Chen Jiongming has since fled Guangdong in April after we defeated his forces. Now, it's time to defeat the remaining resistance.

The outcome is...

- @battlechen: Continue...

@battlechen
on-arrival: {! Q.chen_experience + 0.1;

Q.nra_power = Q.nra_strength * Q.nra_militancy * (1 + Q.nra_experience);
Q.chen_power = Q.chen_strength * Q.chen_militancy * (1 + Q.chen_experience);

Q.nra_casualties = (Q.nra_strength + Q.chen_strength)
    * (Q.chen_power / (Q.nra_power + Q.chen_power)) * 0.1;

Q.chen_casualties = (Q.nra_strength + Q.chen_strength)
    * (Q.nra_power / (Q.nra_power + Q.chen_power)) * 0.1;

Q.nra_vstrength = Math.round(Q.nra_strength*1000);
Q.chen_vstrength = Math.round(Q.chen_strength*1000);

Q.nra_strength -= Q.nra_casualties;
Q.chen_strength -= Q.chen_casualties;

Q.nra_vcasualties = Math.round(Q.nra_casualties*1000);
Q.chen_vcasualties = Math.round(Q.chen_casualties*1000);

if (Q.nra_power > Q.chen_power) {
    Q.nra_experience += 0.1;
    Q.nra_winchen = 1;
} else {
    Q.chen_experience += 0.1;
    Q.nra_losechen = 1;
}
!}
go-to: shanweibattlescreen

@shanweibattlescreen

<div>
  <div id="battle_screen">
    <div style="text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #999; padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <span style="font-size: 24px;">Battle of Shantou</span>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; text-align: center; margin: 20px 30px;">
      <div style="width: 40%;">
        <div style="color: #10186e;">National Revolutionary Army</div>
        <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
          <strong>Troops</strong><br>
          [+ nra_vstrength +]
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 8px;">
          <strong>Casualties</strong><br>
          [+ nra_vcasualties +]
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 20%; font-size: 20px;">VS</div>
      <div style="width: 40%;">
        <div style="color: #b57abf;">Chen Jiongming's Army</div>
        <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
          <strong>Troops</strong><br>
          [+ chen_vstrength +]
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 8px;">
          <strong>Casualties</strong><br>
          [+ chen_vcasualties +]
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #999; padding-top: 15px; margin-top: 20px;">
      <div style="font-size: 14px;">OUTCOME</div>
      [? if nra_winchen = 1 : <div style="font-size: 20px; color: #66BB6A; margin-top: 5px;">National Revolutionary Army Victory</div> ?]
      [? if nra_losechen = 1 : <div style="font-size: 20px; color: #d42f2f; margin-top: 5px;">Chen Jiongming Victory</div> ?]
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

- @win: Victory!
- @lose: Defeat.. Wait, what the fuck?!

@win
view-if: nra_winchen = 1
choose-if: nra_winchen = 1

Chiang Kai-shek has defeated the last of Chen Jiongming's forces. Now, Guangdong is finally safe.

@lose
view-if: nra_losechen = 1
choose-if: nra_losechen = 1

We have somehow LOST to Chen Jiongming's armies in Eastern Guandong! Seeing how weak the NRA is after the battle, Chen Jiongming marched into Canton and seized the city.

Our party leadership has been arrested, Yunnan and Guangxi are stuck in fighting and the Soviets cannot reach us anymore. We cannot be saved.

The Guomindang has failed.

- @freeachievementlolol: Congratulations.

@freeachievementlolol
go-to: game_over
